        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Helen Herz Cohen\n- Organizations: Camp Walden\n- Places: Denmark, Oxford County, Maine, United States\n- Roles: Director\n- Concepts: sexual misconduct with a minor\n\nFacts:\n- Helen Herz Cohen was born in 1912.\n- Camp Walden was an all-girls residential summer camp located in Denmark, a town in Oxford County, Maine, in the United States.\n- Helen Herz Cohen was the Director of Camp Walden until 1986.\n- In 1986, Camp Walden fired Helen Herz Cohen for sexual misconduct with a minor.\n- Helen Herz Cohen died on March 23, 2006.",
